flowchart LR
    C["Copy lines to the<br/>dedicated database<br/>(batched INSERTs)"] --> V{"Fingerprints<br/>identical?"}
    V -->|no| X["Do not switch"]
    V -->|yes| S["Switch the routing"]
    S --> W["A full cycle runs<br/>old rows still there"]
    W --> V2{"Verify again,<br/>routing points at the target?"}
    V2 -->|yes| D["Delete the old rows"]
    S -. "roll back: one routing change" .-> C
    D -. "after this: a copy in the other direction" .-> C
